"name":"雲端/軟體","count":1},{"name":"併購","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-18","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1561550/000162828026008819/ddog-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Our SaaS platform integrates and automates infrastructure monitoring, application performance monitoring, log management, user experience monitoring, cloud security, service management, and many other capabilities to provide unified, real-time observability and security for our customers' entire technology stack. Datadog is used by organizations of all sizes and across a wide range of industries to enable digital transformation and cloud migration, drive collaboration among development, operations, security and business teams, accelerate time to market for applications, reduce time to problem resolution, secure applications and infrastructure, understand user behavior, and track key business metrics.","zh":"我們的SaaS平台整合並自動化基礎設施監控、應用程式效能監控、日誌管理、使用者體驗監控、雲端安全性、服務管理和許多其他功能，為客戶的整個技術堆疊提供統一、即時的可觀察性和安全性。 Datadog 被各種規模和各行各業的組織用來實現數位轉型和雲端遷移，推動開發、營運、安全和業務團隊之間的協作，加快應用程式的上市時間，縮短解決問題的時間，保護應用程式和基礎設施的安全，了解用戶行為並追蹤關鍵業務指標。"},{"en":"Software applications are transforming how organizations engage with customers and operate their businesses. Companies across all industries are re-platforming their businesses to cloud native or hybrid on-premise and cloud infrastructures to enable this digital transformation. And they are increasingly adopting AI capabilities as part of this transformation. Historically, engineering teams and data have been siloed, making the development of next generation applications in dynamic cloud environments challenging. We started Datadog to break this model and facilitate collaboration among development and operations teams, enabling the adoption of DevOps practices. Since then, we have continuously pushed to unify separate tools into an integrated monitoring and analytics platform, readily available to everyone who cares about applications and their impact on business. And while we continue t","zh":"軟體應用程式正在改變組織與客戶互動和經營業務的方式。各行各業的公司都在將業務重新建構為雲端原生或混合本地和雲端基礎設施，以實現數位轉型。作為這項轉型的一部分，他們越來越多地採用人工智慧功能。從歷史上看，工程團隊和數據一直是孤立的，這使得在動態雲端環境中開發下一代應用程式充滿挑戰。我們創辦 Datadog 是為了打破這種模式，促進開發和營運團隊之間的協作，從而實現 DevOps 實踐的採用。從那時起，我們不斷推動將單獨的工具統一到一個整合的監控和分析平台中，每個關心應用程式及其對業務影響的人都可以隨時使用。當我們繼續"},{"en":"With our founding goal of breaking down silos between Dev and Ops, we set out in 2010 to build a real-time data integration platform to turn the chaos of uncorrelated data from disparate sources into digestible and actionable insights. Since launching our first use case with Infrastructure Monitoring in 2012, we have expanded our platform rapidly, and today, we offer end-to-end monitoring and analytics, powered by a common data model that is extensible for use cases across observability, security, software delivery, and service management. In 2025, we launched OnCall to create on-call schedules and integrate real-time observability data into customers' incident response plans, Product Analytics to improve business outcomes and product development decisions with quantitative insights into user experiences and behavior, and Bits AI SRE Agent to autonomously investigate alerts, surface root","zh":"我們的創立目標是打破開發和營運之間的隔閡，我們於 2010 年開始建立一個即時資料整合平台，將不同來源的不相關資料的混亂轉化為易於理解和可操作的見解。自 2012 年推出第一個基礎設施監控用例以來，我們迅速擴展了我們的平台，如今，我們提供端到端監控和分析，由通用資料模型提供支持，該模型可針對可觀察性、安全性、軟體交付和服務管理等用例進行擴展。 2025 年，我們推出了 OnCall，用於創建待命時間表並將實時可觀測性數據整合到客戶的事件響應計劃中；推出產品分析，透過對用戶體驗和行為的定量洞察來改善業務成果和產品開發決策；推出 Bits AI SRE 代理，用於自動調查警報、表面根源"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Our sales team is segmented into four revenue-generating areas: an enterprise sales team that sells to large businesses; a high velocity inside sales team that is focused on acquiring new customers; a customer success team that handles new customer on-boarding and expansions in existing customers; and a partner team that works with resellers, system integrators, referral partners and managed service providers. Each of these teams is further split regionally for geographic coverage across the Americas, Asia-Pacific, or APAC, and Europe, the Middle East and Africa, or EMEA, regions. The sales teams work with marketing to actively pursue leads generated from marketing programs and help take prospective customers through an evaluation and purchase process.","zh":"我們的銷售團隊分為四個創收領域：向大型企業銷售的企業銷售團隊；專注於獲取新客戶的高速內部銷售團隊；客戶成功團隊，負責處理新客戶的加入和現有客戶的擴展；以及與經銷商、系統整合商、推薦合作夥伴和託管服務供應商合作的合作夥伴團隊。每個團隊都按區域進一步劃分，涵蓋美洲、亞太地區或 APAC 以及歐洲、中東和非洲或 EMEA 地區。銷售團隊與行銷部門合作，積極尋找行銷計畫中產生的銷售線索，並幫助潛在客戶完成評估和購買流程。"},{"en":"We focus our multi-touch marketing efforts on the strength of our product innovation, the value we provide, and our domain expertise. We target the development and IT operations community through our marketing activities, using diverse tactics to connect with prospective customers, such as content marketing, email marketing, events, digital advertising, social media, public relations, partner marketing and community initiatives. We offer prospective customers free trials to help them understand the power of our platform. We also host and present at regional, national, global and virtual events to engage both customers and prospects, deliver product training, share best practices and foster community.","zh":"我們將多點觸控行銷工作的重點放在我們的產品創新實力、我們提供的價值以及我們的領域專業知識。我們透過行銷活動瞄準開發和 IT 營運社區，使用多種策略與潛在客戶建立聯繫，例如內容行銷、電子郵件行銷、活動、數位廣告、社交媒體、公共關係、合作夥伴行銷和社區計劃。我們為潛在客戶提供免費試用，幫助他們了解我們平台的強大功能。我們也主辦並出席區域、國家、全球和虛擬活動，以吸引客戶和潛在客戶、提供產品培訓、分享最佳實踐並培養社區。"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"North America","val":2433083000,"zh":"北美洲"},{"name":"US","val":2320300000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"International","val":994075000,"zh":"國際"}],"total":3427158000}},"peers":["NET","ZS","CRWD","MDB","SNOW"]}}